# Certificate checks (cPanel AutoSSL, Let's Encrypt) fetch their files from
# here, and for the mail names (mail.nfelia.com, webmail.nfelia.com, which are
# not behind Cloudflare) they arrive straight from the internet. This re-opens
# the folder that the root .htaccess closes to everything but Cloudflare.
# Nothing else lives here; cPanel writes the files itself.
Require all granted
Options -Indexes
